- Home type and outdoor space: terraced house with a small back garden
- Climate and seasons: temperate, cold wet winters, warm summers
- Household and weekly kitchen scraps: two adults, lots of vegetable peels and coffee grounds
- Garden or brown material available: a few leaves in autumn, cardboard from deliveries
